                                </h2>
                                <div id="collapseMovies" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingMovies" data-bs-parent="#accordionNewestMovies">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        <div class="glass-effect red-border bg-danger-subtle">
                                            <ul class="numbered-list">
