                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card-footer">
                        <div class="dropdown dropstart d-none d-sm-block">
                            <button class="btn btn-danger btn-sm dropdown-toggle" type="button" id="dropdownMenuButton" data-bs-toggle="dropdown" aria-expanded="false">
